{"id": "v08-disj", "title": "либо, или … или, то … то, не то … не то", "blocks": [{"t": "h", "text": "либо"}, {"t": "list", "items": ["either ... or", "or, either that or"]}, {"t": "ex", "items": [["**ли́бо** я, **ли́бо** он", "**either** I **or** he"], ["**ли́бо** оди́н, **ли́бо** друго́й", "**either** one **or** the other"], ["Пое́ду на Кавка́з **ли́бо** в Крым.", "I'll go to the Caucasus, **or** Crimea. / I'll go to the Caucasus, **either that or** Crimea."]]}, {"t": "note", "text": "From Wiktionary, «либо» (en.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 4.0)."}, {"t": "h", "text": "или"}, {"t": "list", "items": ["or", "or else", "either"]}, {"t": "ex", "items": [["Хо́чешь чай **и́ли** ко́фе?", "Do you want tea **or** coffee?"], ["Иди́ сюда́, **и́ли** тебя́ пойма́ю!", "Come here, **or else** I'll go get you!"], ["**и́ли** то́т, **и́ли** друго́й", "**either** the one, **or** the other"]]}, {"t": "note", "text": "From Wiktionary, «или» (en.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 4.0)."}, {"t": "h", "text": "не то"}, {"t": "list", "items": ["the wrong thing, the wrong one, something wrong", "or, or else; lest", "maybe…or maybe; either…or"]}, {"t": "ex", "items": [["Он сказа́л **не то**.", "He said **the wrong** thing."], ["Что-то **не то**.", "Something's **wrong**."], ["Говори́ ти́ше, **не то** услы́шат.", "Keep your voice down **before** they hear us."]]}, {"t": "note", "text": "From Wiktionary, «не то» (en.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 4.0)."}, {"t": "note", "text": "Further sentences, so that every pattern above is practised: from Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR), with their English."}], "exercises": []}